  "notes": [
    "Core changes on this branch: canvas Transform picture bounds (inverseTransformBounds), FractionalTranslation relayout + unbounded hit test, GestureDetector.wantsDrag, touch emulation in HitTestDispatcher, InteractiveViewer wheelScale/panOnScroll.",
    "Method: pnpm perf:engine twice in a detached worktree of baseCommit (base) and twice in the working tree (current), canvas renderer, 3 fresh contexts x 40 frames per scenario, one worker, nothing else running. Each value lists both runs.",
    "paintsPerTick is the regression gate and is identical in every scenario. Medians are engine CPU time (build + drawFrame + finalizeTree); run-to-run variance of the same tree (identity 1.8 vs 2.3 ms for base) exceeds every base/current difference, so no timing change is claimed.",
    "ERD re-render benchmark (pnpm perf:rerender, 3 browsers x 40 frames per combo): one run in the base worktree, two in the working tree; the first working-tree run is the one appended to rerender.ts. Paint medians are identical; the svg/identity 3.1 ms in the first run is build-phase noise (2.2 ms on the repeat, base 1.9 ms)."
